<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108046" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπηρέσ-ιον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cushion on a rower's
				bench,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				8.48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				54.44
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ὑ. καὶ
				κώπην,</span> i.e. to rowers' service, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Them.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>riding-pad</i> or <i>saddle-cloth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rowers' pay,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AB
				312
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπηρετικὸν πλοῖον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Eratosth.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.1.23
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
